config BR2_PACKAGE_TOUCH_TIMEOUT
	bool "touch-timeout"
	help
	  Backlight dimming and power-off daemon for the official
	  Raspberry Pi 7" touchscreen. Dims after inactivity, wakes on
	  touch or SIGUSR1. Auto-detects the backlight and touch input
	  devices, so it works with both the legacy rpi_backlight and
	  the KMS-era 10-0045 sysfs names.

	  https://github.com/ajmccaus/touch-timeout
